                f"status_diagnostic_first_probes={status.get('summary', {}).get('diagnostic_first_probes', 0)}",
                f"quickstart_summary_ready={quickstart_summary_ready}",
                "README is a lightweight entry; status and incident put diagnostic domains before service inventory.",
